# Line endings: LF everywhere, in the repository and in every checkout (also
# on Windows with core.autocrlf=true). Files that end up on Linux (containers,
# Terraform, Lambda, SSM, user data) then never get CRLF, and hashes of files
# are the same on every machine. Rule and reasons: docs/conventions.md,
# "Line endings".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.psd1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf

# Binary files: never convert or diff as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
